# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated artifacts and the video author's material.
#
# This repository holds the pipeline. Everything below is either produced BY the
# pipeline from the source videos, or is the video author's own content, so it is
# deliberately not published. Rebuild any of it locally with scripts/ - see the
# README section "Reproducing the bank".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# built by scripts/build_exam_db.py
exam/*.db

# built by scripts/export_exam_app.py; embeds every question and explanation
exam-app/pca-exam.html

# screenshots of the video's slides
Questions/

# Google's official exam case-study PDFs (exam material, not ours)
Case Study/

# generated pages that quote the narration, and their catalogs
wiki/entities/
wiki/raw/
wiki/index.md
wiki/log.md
